[engl]
{100}{}{Tandi}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{Greetings}
{1020}{}{Tandi Rescue begin}
{1030}{}{Tandi rescue finished}
{1040}{}{Escape through backdoor}
{1050}{}{Duel finished}
{1060}{}{Low int}
{2000}{}{Hello again! What can I help you with now?}
{2010}{}{Can I ask you a few more questions?}
{2020}{}{Nothing. Goodbye.}
{3000}{}{Sure, I guess. I've never been out of here, so I don't know what help I can be. So,
what'cha need?}
{3010}{}{What else is around these parts?}
{3020}{}{What's going on around here?}
{3030}{}{What's going on around here?}
{3040}{}{What's going on around here?}
{3050}{}{Have you heard any stories from down south?}
{3060}{}{How do you like it here?}
{3070}{}{Well, that's about it. Thanks for your time.}
{4000}{}{Junktown's to the southwest, but I don't know how far. Then there's some weird place below that called the City of Death. Oh, oh yeah there's this other place...Oh, shoot, what was that? Oh, yeah, the Hub.@@There's a bunch of cities down south. But since you're such a great traveler, I'm sure
you know that already.}
{4010}{}{Thanks.}
{5000}{}{The weirdest story I've heard is about the Death Claw.}
{5010}{}{Thanks.}
{5020}{}{Deathclaw?}
{6000}{}{It's okay, I guess. I mean, it is home and all, but it's so boring! You know, I want to
see the world.}
{6010}{}{If you're so bored, why don't you leave?}
{6020}{}{Well, I'm sure it's not that bad.}
{6030}{}{It seems nice and safe here.}
{7000}{}{No problem. Anything else?}
{7010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{8000}{}{We got Rad Scorpions! I mean, I know it's not a good thing, but no one's died from the
stings. And it's the closest thing to excitement we've got here!}
{8010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{9000}{}{Nothing much, since you whomped those Rad Scorpions. Gee, I wish I could have seen that.}
{9010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{10000}{}{Same as always. Bo-ring.}
{10010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{11000}{}{I heard a tale from a traveller up from the south. He said the Death Claw was a creature that killed people at night. He said no one can catch it, because it can disappear like smoke. Not that I believe it, of course.}
{11010}{}{[Done.]}
{12000}{}{Who are you? What do you want?}
{12010}{}{I'm your fairy god-mother. What's it look like?}
{12020}{}{My name is @pname@, and your father sent me.}
{12030}{}{Duh.}
{13000}{}{Let's get outta here.}
{13010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> tandi30]}
{13020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> tandi43]}
{13030}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> tandi43b]}
{13040}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> tandi36]}
{13050}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> tandi01]}
{13060}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> tandi37]}
{14000}{}{Uh...I have to stand over here now.}
{14010}{}{[Done.]}
{15000}{}{Oh, it's you again! Are you going to get me out?}
{15010}{}{No, I'm just stopping by to say hi.}
{15020}{}{Duh.}
{15030}{}{Yes, so just sit tight. I'll get you out.}
{16000}{}{This is no time to talk, we have to get out of here.}
{16010}{}{[Done.]}
{17000}{}{Hi! I was afraid that you were gone and I wasn't going to get a chance to thank you for rescuing me. Aw! That was great! Action, adventure...Anyway, if there's anything that I can do for you, you just ask.}
{17010}{}{Nope, that's it, thanks.}
{17020}{}{How about a few more questions?}
{17030}{}{Dungh!!}
{17040}{}{How about you and I...well, you know...get together.}
{18000}{}{Well, thanks for talking. We don't get many strangers here, so it's always good to talk
to new people. Well, see ya!}
{18010}{}{'Bye.}
{19000}{}{Hello, anybody home? Could you get me out of here? Could you GET ME OUT OF HERE!}
{19010}{}{[Done.]}
{20000}{}{Well, what's your plan?}
{20010}{}{Just wait for the doors to open. Then run for it!}
{20020}{}{I'm going to fight the Khan leader in exchange for your freedom.}
{21000}{}{Uh...hey, thanks. Later.}
{21010}{}{[Done.]}
{22000}{}{Oh, aren't we the sarcastic one? Are you going to get me out, or what!?}
{22010}{}{Yeah. Just hold on, and when you see the door open, run for it.}
{22020}{}{I'm going to fight the Khan leader in exchange for your freedom.}
{23000}{}{That's it? That's your plan. Ugh! All right. But hurry. I heard them talking and I
didn't like their plans.}
{23010}{}{[Done.]}
{24000}{}{You? Fight him? You got to be kidding me! [Sigh] Listen, if you come up with another
plan, let me know, okay?}
{24010}{}{[Done.]}
{25000}{}{Me, leave? I wish. I don't know enough to leave alone and no one else wants to go, and
worst of all, my father says he would have a heart attack if something happened to me!}
{25010}{}{Shoot, I have to go. Good luck.}
{25020}{}{Tough situation. Can I ask you a few questions, though?}
{26000}{}{You live here all your life and see how you like it! Anything else you want to know?}
{26010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{27000}{}{Yeah, real safe...and so boring I think my brain's going to leak out of my ear at any moment.}
{27010}{}{Sorry to hear that, but I don't have much time. Can I ask you a few questions?}
{27020}{}{Why don't you leave?}
{28000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'tandi36a']}
{28010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> tandi27]}
{29000}{}{Hi! I heard there was a traveller in town, but I was kinda skeptical until I saw you. My name's Tandi, what's yours?}
{29010}{}{Uhhh?}
{30000}{}{@sex@|I'm not that kind of girl, mister. Go find a Brahma or something.| |Listen...uh...but I...uh...I-I like guys, okay? Whew! Uh, excuse me, I got stuff to do.|}
{30010}{}{[Done.]}
{31000}{}{Uh, listen. I have to go take care of the Brahmas. It was, uh, nice talking to ya.}
{31010}{}{[Done.]}

